usage: cast [-h] [--tv [IP]] [-tg] [--ru | --en] [--release N] [--pick N]
            [--menu] [--file N] [--voice [N|STUDIO]] [--new] [--dry]
            [--since SPAN] [--version]
            [query ...]

torrcast - find a release and cast it to the TV without downloading

positional arguments:
  query               the title, or stop / status

options:
  -h, --help          show this help message and exit
  --tv [IP]           TV setup: without an address - find receivers on the
                      network and pick from the list
  -tg                 open the Telegram bot setup menu
  --ru                switch to Russian and remember the choice
  --en                switch to English and remember the choice
  --release N         debug: release N of the chosen picture; numbers come
                      from cast releases with the same query
  --pick N            picture N from the menu, without asking
  --menu              show the list of pictures and ask, instead of switching
                      on by itself
  --file N            debug: take file N of the release
  --voice [N|STUDIO]  voice: number or studio - take and remember, no value -
                      menu
  --new               the same release, file and track from the start
  --dry               the whole resolve without casting
  --since SPAN        cast log: since when (2d / 12h / 30m / YYYY-MM-DD)
  --version           show program's version number and exit
